  "interface.add_your_first_downloader_client_t_5ec1dede": {
    es: "Añade tu primer cliente de descarga para activar las descargas automáticas. Entre los clientes compatibles están Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd y NZBGet.",
    "zh-Hans":
      "添加首个下载客户端以启用自动下载。支持的客户端包括 Transmission、rTorrent、qBittorrent、Synology Download Station、Real-Debrid、SABnzbd 和 NZBGet。",
    hi: "स्वचालित डाउनलोड चालू करने के लिए अपना पहला डाउनलोड क्लाइंट जोड़ें। समर्थित क्लाइंट में Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd और NZBGet शामिल हैं।",
    de: "Fügen Sie Ihren ersten Download-Client hinzu, um automatische Downloads zu aktivieren. Unterstützt werden Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd und NZBGet.",
    ja: "最初のダウンロードクライアントを追加すると、自動ダウンロードを有効にできます。対応クライアント：Transmission、rTorrent、qBittorrent、Synology Download Station、Real-Debrid、SABnzbd、NZBGet。",
    fr: "Ajoutez votre premier client de téléchargement pour activer les téléchargements automatiques. Les clients pris en charge sont Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd et NZBGet.",
    "pt-BR":
      "Adicione seu primeiro cliente de download para ativar os downloads automáticos. Entre os clientes compatíveis estão Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd e NZBGet.",
    ar: "أضف أول عميل تنزيل لتفعيل التنزيلات التلقائية. تشمل العملاء المدعومين Transmission وrTorrent وqBittorrent وSynology Download Station وReal-Debrid وSABnzbd وNZBGet.",
    ko: "첫 다운로드 클라이언트를 추가하면 자동 다운로드를 사용할 수 있습니다. 지원되는 클라이언트: Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd, NZBGet.",
    "zh-Hant":
      "新增第一個下載用戶端以啟用自動下載。支援的用戶端包括 Transmission、rTorrent、qBittorrent、Synology Download Station、Real-Debrid、SABnzbd 和 NZBGet。",
    vi: "Thêm ứng dụng khách tải xuống đầu tiên để bật tính năng tải tự động. Các ứng dụng khách được hỗ trợ gồm Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd và NZBGet.",
    id: "Tambahkan klien unduhan pertama untuk mengaktifkan unduhan otomatis. Klien yang didukung meliputi Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd, dan NZBGet.",
    "es-419":
      "Añade tu primer cliente de descarga para activar las descargas automáticas. Entre los clientes compatibles están Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd y NZBGet.",
    "fr-CA":
      "Ajoutez votre premier client de téléchargement pour activer les téléchargements automatiques. Les clients pris en charge sont Transmission, rTorrent, qBittorrent, Synology Download Station, Real-Debrid, SABnzbd et NZBGet.",
  },
